OL,3,ALeah Croucher: 'Not knowing was
OL,4,Atorture, knowing is as bad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Leah Croucher's body was found
OL,7,Fthree years after she went missing her
OL,8,Ffamily thought their torture would end.
OL,9,FInstead it continued with conspiracy
OL,10,Ftheories, fear and heartbreak haunting
OL,11,Ftheir lives.
OL,13,FThe 19-year-old was walking to work on
OL,14,F15 February 2019 when she disappeared.
OL,15,FHer parents say they went through more
OL,16,Fthan three years of "absolute torture"
OL,17,Fbefore her dismembered body was
OL,18,Fdiscovered in a house in Milton Keynes,
OL,19,Fless than half a mile (0.8km) from her
OL,20,Fhome in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
