OL,3,ALeah Croucher: 'Not knowing was
OL,4,Atorture, knowing is as bad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe had been killed by a repeat sex
OL,7,Foffender Neil Maxwell, a man who her
OL,8,Fparents have branded "an animal". He
OL,9,Fwas on the run from police at the time.
OL,11,FDespite overwhelming evidence of
OL,12,FMaxwell's guilt, her parents Claire and
OL,13,FJohn say they have been subjected to
OL,14,F"devastating" speculation online, with
OL,15,Fsome pointing the finger at her
OL,16,Fbrother.
